        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG700, Stainless Steel Modern Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Stainless Steel Coat Hook is a great way to add modern style to your entry way. This contemporary coat hook can be installed by your front door to hold all those items that usually get thrown right on the floor. And since it is a hook, it is versatile. Hang a few in the bathroom to hold towels and robes. A stylish hook like this one installed in your office or restaurant is a great place for people to hang their purses. The AHI SIG700 Stainless Steel Modern Hook comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG700-specifications.gif?v=1704354774\" width=\"431\" height=\"271\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG700 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI Hardware No.700 Coat Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Hook Height: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG700-specifications.pdf?v=1691093350\" target=\"new\"><b>AHI SIG700 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
